{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1455,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ed7c5088847a125220b1436",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是现在这种状态…\r\n现在这个最佳状态，应该能做到。\r\n不过，结果好像是…做到了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcc7f72cad6f41b25d8783428935a4c7a04cd649864a5d8c48e9e3c8cef2c1e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a6a34d830214e8fff17d5f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感、感谢指导…",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c9a436b51d98230f9855250b0bde3f97a4b259500b3d2bd2f3a1b0b1d558694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46981e7a5d4508ead6666081",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やるぞ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0719590def11f6196a343b633667ad52bdf4f06ecaa1a326c4421f4075b5f86b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8e83740fb925e25ccc4f483",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶…下一次，我…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdf3f85693cbd3977cf6987370595d93547541c3c133f8db4577848fe9e00fd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3995db941884581ae7a812c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还没能结束吗…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54f93c2808ed5786bcefc49a773d2c8e626c1dbc4aa43bf5769098e8c2eaca4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89be128a6317b3ababb773b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，还要更努力才行…",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeaf2e5b28357e496d2bbb316fa413bc37bde0206bde4627e0a98a7ba24a7d85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c61f1cb0fdb40624c71be9b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "离大家…好遥远…",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1b7f9cfc8703af44698003086190aece84cd25cffe23ac878a21a3fdfc42ea4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:895785d50c0bc6c5c8170b3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不是其他人…而是我吗！\r\n是我赢了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23e9a69f6ac26ea52897f40cf2a33e2dc70d7c4075ca0c053dd9688dda830066",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6388bdd61d3c694ac5a0abe8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天可以稍微自信一点吧…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52e6c8aba0597e0f28d7596c0c6a706d1940db13ccdabeab1919f47db8ba513b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f5775e8abb52c7a68753022",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，我要上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7aa283f9f9e059522332f593cafda7154e2645aa9206a3a2159f7dc7cfe8122a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e85486c74e90a801b130cc53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要得到大家的认可…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57c27a567c280cfaa8afb1df91c3f9bd0dc19156e783295191cfee39ec9d55b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caee52a1a9193241ac425f1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里餐厅的“酥脆炸鸡配梅子酱”……\n好好吃啊……  如果再点一份，\n会不会不太礼貌啊……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "171849ce0696637a2993d10b6cd73f5d16e1a14e2903a17eb8a5478b454b8b9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a5511c22d7e2be237e5cf1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还有可以出海钓鱼的方案啊……  \n自由活动时间好想去试试……嗯？  \n居、居然能钓到金枪鱼……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "48dc0ed86fab4cf0dd9c1de025fb7bba2c2a03351dc46ed0a296fe30900fd4d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:707e3be56476e4496c429aa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素质同学她们的演唱会好厉害，\r\n各自都有被爱的原因，那…我――",
      "source_fingerprint": "264950e66a0e21f680ffa79b606f331331eab285c0500076f0d2e92e276596f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49584595cad258d7913c49ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果……买了那种大胆款式的泳衣的话……\n不，不行，我肯定不适合！\n等我再有点自信……果然还是不行啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76209cd14bd0d27864c6a0c1f38543d9fb8a52f43a190c04693b27649fb7e02e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:694bfe5d599ea6045ad8b1a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是我――…即便是我――…纵使是我――…\r\n哪怕是我――…！也想成为“伟大的赛马娘”…！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7806b338d05aea6ea67c4c6595ba4c673855cdad8d9afe8c47a5e5230f92dcaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1e71ea3dfab04a198213e85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便是这样的我，\r\n也有人在支持我…虽然还没有自信…\r\n但是，我想要…回应这份支持。",
      "source_fingerprint": "340655319283a33bcb2a70affebb471bb1891bfd16493dff0ad599a44bd5f322",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f73232852f4ad511d5c093b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，冷静下来…只要按照平时训练那样做――",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb154801cab81b5172eeb464b466f5631aa140fa7b90fa2cf8a5c60273e06ffe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1965b8cda990d18ff24cebed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "炒热气氛这种事情…我也能做到吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6c916aa233f0eaa559bc0db7b84fc76401b5c151bf525b41421b77d0b64a697",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a760b2e657ad058cd2f3f54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总有一天\r\n我会成为“伟大的赛马娘”的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4de7505d317fc145269988aed6a2093081d9295d9c80e8f7ce1077967f498dce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1634da31335dc59df5cc11c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还没有足够的自信。\r\n但，但是…我信任\r\n相信着我的你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6663ce91141d417fb01e885a55a5afac040d2d83d1a5e4c8e9fde73e71b4fe53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89fcfb0575246156b3be039a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我居然也是学校的一员…\r\n现在看来也跟骗人似的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4c2226c2c019bb2253950d872dc9766029db4fa5bfcb96e7df5625c079c66cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0693e6d63ee613770dc481a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，能被人看见好多，好羞耻…",
      "source_fingerprint": "66edef7ddcf0531e2c33bcc8f436bdb1dd207e07745492565d37e15d0cdda340",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:009daee3cdb4044c917920b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要变得更强…\r\n想要更配得上这身决胜服…",
      "source_fingerprint": "b67920efead273ee889caf0d78717fc14dcb70c7d368ef82e96d80034e9dac95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cdd1a0307a0e71c2969973d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "熨衣服的技术…多少进步一点了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec654cfcc3e9052bfb5fef990cc6410bfa00f7ab59e14ac375421b616a5a5217",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:096c9b7eaa980d11370d0882",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在舞台上唱歌还不太习惯…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3edbff5ef5942e24fc9c80bd9dcc0ce62e1bc57a72853e426fdaf52242c628b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3754bb4f96943cc2fb6cd232",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～…堂堂正正，堂堂正正地…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28af9c27e677477fdd68fb1371e860351d0f41d8d3151dc61111e6449187ee9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a82113282c9debd0bfcd91ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不觉得奇怪就好…",
      "source_fingerprint": "09d2c8a6ee4f42c506b2c1aa144684556c708cc13b935b73efd79f876d74f18d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7b82c41391fdae1ea183bb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔也会有这种情况…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8606d33a33f8f76a3bc4da27d3c6c969ff4fa2c259fb4f253a68f13b896cd85f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b82bc7aab90f61881395e7c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我居然也是学校的一员…\r\n现在看来也跟骗人似的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4c2226c2c019bb2253950d872dc9766029db4fa5bfcb96e7df5625c079c66cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd925bb50fd69f2b8fcd25ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，能被看见好多…好害羞…",
      "source_fingerprint": "2acd8cced5eeb9d80ba5a8b5e728c0d4e647b20e6fb4858d4a29b24ce1a4de57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0ae37e3d26118efb6531c7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要变得更强…\r\n想要更配得上决胜服…",
      "source_fingerprint": "47acb489a74a6ecda10b96b857d5948d9ed2f47080f613df496d025332980f0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26215d2c09237e69b2c73946",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "熨衣服的技术…多少进步一点了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec654cfcc3e9052bfb5fef990cc6410bfa00f7ab59e14ac375421b616a5a5217",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a23207d1890e5250221fd28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在舞台上唱歌还不太习惯…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3edbff5ef5942e24fc9c80bd9dcc0ce62e1bc57a72853e426fdaf52242c628b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b974c9d29266d7fe4df272d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～…堂堂正正，堂堂正正地…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28af9c27e677477fdd68fb1371e860351d0f41d8d3151dc61111e6449187ee9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55b1567a9f2f1cc31f9b66fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不觉得奇怪就好…",
      "source_fingerprint": "09d2c8a6ee4f42c506b2c1aa144684556c708cc13b935b73efd79f876d74f18d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3904b6ad362d4e4c345c7b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔也会有这种情况…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8606d33a33f8f76a3bc4da27d3c6c969ff4fa2c259fb4f253a68f13b896cd85f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73cc267e7122ed71bb4325ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df01281aeb636ff58c0e666f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好。\r\n那个，额…呃…\r\n啊…这个早上真好啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "025365611a01018b55891b04855b0c50b5d7489caecec0c25dec03ae069e0e49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:975b86c904e345dd762ab72a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在想听一下训练计划，\r\n可以吗？…那个，想要现在\r\n多少脑袋里先有个印象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40ae465db6bb16f9abdee1db65738c622aca7749b1bb6cd20a7822f775ae8fb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2066a611413f7178713597a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上课时的内容全部卸下来的话，\r\n笔记本不够用啊…\r\n大家都是怎么解决的呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f2057b25db764e2af9c02a7d7e3ce9195e222b6e8ee9f52644aa50eb11fa4a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cef9ad81526dff9ae7b6df9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，午休的时候\r\n想检查一下跑步的姿势…\r\n可以跟我一起看录像吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "35b8dcd3468a1dca83ebcca65442fb4ea1494a7c282e873a98137dc41544f85d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87f2e3364500d8950803cf3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像又做了奇怪的梦。\r\n起床的时候下巴感觉很累…\r\n到处去吃东西的梦已经做得够多了吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bc3a52cf1d97db7211acfd6775b151c0d88b21170bd3014751d5e3047a377b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:391a65e341e1904709ea5e71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔…晚上不能喝太多的水\r\n我不想起床…\r\n然后和『那个』撞个正着…",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecbdad8f80d70bc43556de5bdd18324608d14acc1705e308e2063347a7c92412",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7451c01277e02f4c9d91326",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新生们看起来速度都很快呢…\r\n为了不被追上，\r\n必须更加努力才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7be901c39970d21c584083283a425e2d575b4388e9717e64787cb282542ad9fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75ec46ee47e504d140d98971",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太阳晒着不热吗…？\r\n那个…要不要戴上帽子、\r\n这样可能会舒服一些…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4c1d42a0bb837b96957e15f527ac61907852fcf24122ea5ebe2a92bd3f4355f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:402146efd2d38b57c7a0170e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竹夹鱼、青花鱼、乌贼…\r\n唔，转哪个点呢。\r\n…要不全都去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efeb894077ea68b9bd2bb9c8b1df49e4adb8e487d10eaf64e8dbacd040866545",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a658f3d94e8dedbcfcadc825",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天我爸爸休息的时候…\r\n会带我去冰钓。\r\n每年这个时候我都很期待…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ad76ca83ea61133c239a04f291564ba5b68be849eacec02f8cad9297393ed55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b88e1b898f9685512e016fda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你……快乐……情人节",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae1bbabaa14256a30aa9bc77f939359fec6528bb53124d9ff79b68511d589b60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaea3935af820792f6ef96e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须把手帕还给北部同学…\r\n但是，她总被好多人包围着…\r\n想要进到人群里的话…唔…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e859de3457f19e71325a5b8bf6fe9ad7d5c8e142ff90b60cfa5aba56bcf2813f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bb4f62ab9ada4ee00f94a24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『钓鱼老师』什么的…\r\n光钻同学好像有点\r\n太看得起我了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "37665706aeb207d3362761c922339e661cb9af12b23ac9f26c80e51bfbb215bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9507efb6cce722a3f84781da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皇冠同学的美食评测写的太好了…\r\n呼…香港的肉包子\r\n我也好想尝尝…",
      "source_fingerprint": "74cfda48c925aace20e83252c572a8e93d524060025701060b519eec1a354398",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6541b39d0d8b5fd7923c1422",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想玩投接球…\r\n但是想到要跟人交流…的话。\r\n…今天还是跟墙壁玩吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd9c8c41e29b18eead603030629eb0dfd47fb5656abb07289ed50b9779416403",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f981f96b1c314126b3f362f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天早上的报纸，\r\n姐姐的报道又占了很大的版面…\r\n唔，差距怎么会这么大呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "02c3413f31276ae49085efc499f1019ee7acfd5af36ae988828f3727f1183b5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a6653f7a616ff6dec167ddb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然想当第一名…但是。\r\n站在舞台中间这种事情，\r\n我真的能胜任吗…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d317b32daede7601ef7b34c39d2fa96b6d3e1d489d9d75144dc6fdd5281379d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a29c4bec031ea12fa9cb8424",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的我看起来不奇怪吗？\r\n比如衣服不合身，\r\n不适合穿这种类型之类的…",
      "source_fingerprint": "948843d27e0df572d66e59cd45eb0dc681316973b4f11f27ca70aad93e3a0911",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e84f28942c94fa33247405d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个斗篷不管什么时候看都很漂亮…\r\n像发光的浮游生物一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef1918d90677ade7091ebf749b314aa25f6f3e08a2a5ccaec250370fc78ae1cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4482468c535ae771e9b607d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只有穿着这个的时候，\r\n感觉会引人注目也无所谓。\r\n感觉好得…就不像是我自己一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c2f7bcc81db045d1d5248a07d453417a5c9fdde1a910c3eda33dc3fb1739272",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69b27ed2587963dbae65aa91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大鸣大放同学，\r\n又是第一批去晨练的。\r\n…我也要再起早一点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64d2bbe2d7a35b5effb934a606379936f01fcb72db8d2300c52fb86a69b1cbca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:357c1216454d6ed2c4289a20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白天也在演奏，万籁同学，\r\n她果然很喜欢音乐。\r\n…好漂亮的音色啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "434f7b579f9e02957c9e80710ee0b1fda5c828b2ce84103fbda8c524f2a92a09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0a4176bd44a162a0dc424ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作业已经做好了，课本也准备好了。\r\n接下来就睡觉…\r\n唔，再检查一遍吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ab3375ea0e7b97eb8f001e7fa130b55b1365f32f4ee1879b86f993002b675d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7abd84dba6663391361c8abc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，最近钓到一条好大的黑鲷鱼！\r\n呃…啊，不，不\r\n就这样，没什么，仅此而已…",
      "source_fingerprint": "02015f02b9eb04844977b56891c331992f2e34086efcd3d5cbf44e575d8f411e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d686346c2f4bfd5f7e16f31a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妹妹强击送的泳衣…\r\n怎么办…！？穿不了这种飘逸\r\n又色彩缤纷的类型…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e33603346826ca598d3543a66aa910b56ea5c6f0a198a175cf7c7b1ac61b0e10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:056f2040aa53da7ee49c1025",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "澳大利亚现在是春天。\r\n如果把枫叶的图片发给在那边的青梅竹马，\r\n一定会被吓一跳吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "fca4caba145c98fca3bef9e49718978a9c312e2fa40a2cc36aa99a5aebeed1a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:426e3629479269548b2aaea8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天的肉包…感觉格外好吃。\r\n在寒冷的天气，热气腾腾的\r\n………呼…",
      "source_fingerprint": "2400fd34653fe6af47e734d870332b87a36411d6b48a9be804836d65459ecbf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f91854dbd1e0cb691e8dbb63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了不让我肚子着凉，父母给我\n寄了肚兜。只是，那种……\n那么可爱的狗狗图案，有点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d6272d60dea6cfa1f7f6b7839c20edfd9d75f0b1ec38e71ab6302f59ae1324e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8054417f565febb1d6c473f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只有卫衣是我自己选的。\n所以，被你夸奖……\n我真的很开心……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c367073571bcbb2afd95710ba0416cc7b7a1c097baf7011886af46b52ac10ca7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f84ad33ad13dc9ecfdefd7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚上的指甲油掉了……要不要再\n去找强击或者皇冠同学……\n不、这次我想自己试试看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c23a949798433086323288dbba7753436c1fe77a6518c234e9c42ffd4257b5b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ba04ab8450342f0e9265741",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐她们也在训练吗？\r\n…唔，不，集中精力，集中精力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "455e67bc123211adfb48fcecfe4c81a8cda6f2cab3ba0d4bdc63a87d2025aae3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:784d27124c024ea3d313e884",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "しまっていこう",
      "source_fingerprint": "56f6d0bf6a3e534ab4f8a54e3013003aa3b07f8486fa7d39ab88423b88ffeda9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3c6b7cd98cbd204c008b2d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以在加强一点训练强度吗…？\r\n如果还没有成效的话…",
      "source_fingerprint": "531c4331ffaacbaa14f112dd8520e38c14916762c38e2eb4350f2f4ff2cbd61e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75b0500b78b2fa5467dd677b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃…如果有什么在意的地方，\r\n可以帮我指出来吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e49f28e581200d1fb2128dc0589f818b60abaf909025d34af12a08dadd005802",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:368dceb9394b9b2ef8fc8f23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…吃下去的零食得赶紧消化掉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ed7509957bb57eec2cb68ddb4bbf4167e56eb2d45f3cfcd520deec3d2a6edca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee2e4fbb2cdd0dab91c5bf13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，现在的我看起来怎么样？\r\n比起那时候…有稍微成长一些吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c069e58231a1b4f3bd5e806bff3d3b0d8e4e9ab951f2d14b55b50ef16b3d1bc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:376a4fcbb7cd33a953320f96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有训练员在身边的话就可以安心了。\r\n…可以安心地前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5433d7641d27c72859034ae3d1b2705131cf0d6fd83a40d20c717a411855c88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0298a412188d16373a60665",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个…谢谢。\r\n谢谢你选择了我。成为了…\r\n我的训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c09a3fc222358f999e99102bfc9321da76076cc51fbda54f3377fa52b869305",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94ce2e22d7aea45e40c68d90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "沙子的触感…好…\r\n…唔，集中精神，集中精神…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dae952e15bfc67be9119f455d6d45efd8879ea654d4b505597a5cbc76e0395fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee8808b7cb958dab4ea81a10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然称不上是夏日的太阳，\n但我也会燃烧起斗志……\n加、加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d87386ed74993b0d6c574a3cc6eae12b038fcc07112e7aa901381908b766ec2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2368419b853e0a1fab1ad5e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了防止缺水和缺盐，我带了很多\n运动饮料……\n会不会带太多了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b10acf80b2f2aee78466847b5c7818493108002c7203eed44791503b95badcda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f172fbfe0cab438edc210c11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像这身泳装一样，稍微大胆一点……\n大胆的训练……会是什么呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "90514d4231c1e0c8d45d8fb4b9d64c00379eca6585f770f88124ccabc1228606",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92017"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
